  "power.lightsabersfork.sensitivity.desc": "§fThe Force awakens. Unlocks your energy pool and basic double jump.\n§7This connection allows you to specialize into paths via Holocrons.",
  "power.lightsabersfork.jump.desc": "§fLet the Force propel you across vast distances.\n§7Protects against all fall damage upon landing.",
  "power.lightsabersfork.push.desc": "§fChannel kinetic energy to violently knock enemies backwards.\n§7Higher ranks drastically increase reach and momentum.",
  "power.lightsabersfork.pull.desc": "§fCreate a vacuum in the Force pulling entities and items directly to you.\n§7Useful for retrieving dropped lightsabers or reeling in targets.",
  "power.lightsabersfork.speed.desc": "§fAccelerate your physical reflexes and movement.\n§7Temporarily increases movement and leap velocity.",
  "power.lightsabersfork.sight.desc": "§fOpen your mind to the surrounding environment.\n§7Grants night vision and outlines all living beings through walls.",

  "power.lightsabersfork.heal.desc": "§bHarness the Light Side to rapidly repair cellular tissue.\n§7Higher ranks restore larger amounts of health.",
  "power.lightsabersfork.fortify.desc": "§bErect a barrier of pure Force energy around yourself.\n§7Massively mitigates incoming damage while channeled.",
  "power.lightsabersfork.stun.desc": "§bOverpower enemy minds with a shockwave of pacification.\n§7Slows, weakens, and disorients targets in your line of sight.",
  "power.lightsabersfork.resist.desc": "§bHarden your physical body against elemental harm.\n§7Grants complete immunity to fire and heat damage.",
  "power.lightsabersfork.meditation.desc": "§bEnter a deep trance to regenerate body and focus.\n§7Steadily restores health and saturation.",

  "power.lightsabersfork.lightning.desc": "§cUnleash raw hatred in the form of devastating Force Lightning.\n§7Deals continuous area damage while channeled.",
  "power.lightsabersfork.choke.desc": "§cConstrict the windpipe of your victim from a distance.\n§7Immobilizes the target and inflicts steady asphyxiation damage.",
  "power.lightsabersfork.drain.desc": "§cSiphon the life force of your target to replenish your own.\n§7Damages the victim while healing the caster.",
  "power.lightsabersfork.stealth.desc": "§cBend light waves and deceive enemy senses.\n§7Renders the user invisible while channeled.",

